    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d672">

                <pb facs="0637" n="465" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg465"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/4719</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Curtis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-05-17T10:00:00-00:43">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 17, 1917, 10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received, 2.15 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Bacchante</hi> returned 15th to await instructions. Last
                    night large meeting of citizens from various sections of the Republic
                    enthusiastically endorsed action of Government concerning Germany without a
                    dissenting vote. Approval of citizens down coast also made known, including the
                    Chief Justice. The dominant note sounded was that no guaranty from the
                    Government of the United States was necessary because the attitude of the
                    Government of the United States towards Liberia in the past is a sufficient
                    guaranty as to the future.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Curtis</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
